{"id": "in-the-job-before-the-exam", "title": "City jobs: one permanent hire in seven was already in the seat; generic titles doubled", "seconds": 149.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "8334aeaf5f5d6955", "words": 423, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Most San Francisco jobs are filled by an open contest.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.18, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "A job posting", "sub": "open to anyone"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "A test", "sub": "the civil-service exam"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "A ranked list", "sub": "the top names get hired"}], "kicker": "How City hiring works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.64, 1.12, 1.5, 1.64, 1.94, 2.1, 2.18, 2.43]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "A posting, a test, and a ranked list of who scored best.", "t0": 3.3, "t1": 6.64, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "A job posting", "sub": "open to anyone"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "A test", "sub": "the civil-service exam"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "A ranked list", "sub": "the top names get hired"}], "kicker": "How City hiring works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.76, 0.9, 1.54, 1.71, 1.77, 2.04, 2.33, 2.42, 2.62, 2.96]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "But how often does the winner already sit in that job?", "t0": 6.76, "t1": 9.95, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Permanent hires since October 2018", "sub": "22,243 we can match to the payroll"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.4, 0.65, 0.79, 0.9, 1.2, 1.59, 1.9, 2.0, 2.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "Out of 22,243 permanent", "t0": 9.95, "t1": 12.6, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Permanent hires since October 2018", "sub": "22,243 we can match to the payroll"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.28, 0.8, 1.23, 1.42, 1.69, 2.3]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "hires since 2018,", "t0": 12.6, "t1": 14.89, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Permanent hires since October 2018", "sub": "22,243 we can match to the payroll"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.69, 0.94, 1.21]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "how many?", "t0": 14.89, "t1": 15.91, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Permanent hires since October 2018", "sub": "22,243 we can match to the payroll"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.27]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "3,290.", "t0": 15.91, "t1": 17.61, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "3,290", "label": "already paid in that job, that department", "sub": "about one in seven"}, "emph": ["3,290"], "wt": [0.04, 0.33, 0.75, 0.99, 1.3]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "That’s about one in seven. This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 18.13, "t1": 21.2, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.45, 0.65, 0.78, 1.55, 1.75, 1.86, 1.93, 2.41, 2.58, 2.64]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "9 official reports since 2020 looked at City hiring.", "t0": 21.42, "t1": 24.76, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "What reviewers found", "sub": "9 reports, 2020 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.65, 1.09, 1.33, 1.64, 2.27, 2.53, 2.64, 2.89]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "One problem keeps coming up: it’s slow. How slow?", "t0": 24.88, "t1": 29.04, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "What reviewers found", "sub": "9 reports, 2020 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.55, 0.81, 1.08, 1.48, 1.81, 2.79, 3.05]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "255 days.", "t0": 29.04, "t1": 30.62, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "255 days", "label": "to fill a City job, civil grand jury, 2023"}, "emph": ["255"], "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.48, 1.07]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Where they found favoritism, it came through side doors, like a promotion made through a very unusual process.", "t0": 31.14, "t1": 37.14, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "through a very unusual process"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.36, 0.67, 1.63, 1.78, 2.05, 2.27, 2.56, 3.35, 3.54, 3.59, 4.04, 4.25, 4.45, 4.54, 4.92, 5.44]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "After an appeal, the Civil Service Commission had the utility review five years of hiring.", "t0": 37.26, "t1": 42.28, "shot": "b6a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Civil Service Commission", "sub": "five years of hiring, two classes", "kicker": "After an appeal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.38, 1.25, 1.39, 1.68, 2.01, 2.42, 2.55, 2.66, 3.1, 3.69, 4.11, 4.46, 4.57]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "It reported 10 hires. 9 were temporary exempt.", "t0": 42.4, "t1": 45.31, "shot": "b6b", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "9 of 10", "label": "hires were temporary exempt", "sub": "Public Utilities Commission, two classes, five years"}, "emph": ["9"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.52, 0.85, 1.44, 1.8, 1.96, 2.47]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[0]"], "text": "The first lead: how were those 3,290 people already in the job?", "t0": 45.83, "t1": 51.5, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "In the seat first", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "temporary, exempt or provisional"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 1.3, 1.57, 1.76, 2.02, 2.34, 2.77, 2.98, 3.31, 3.69, 4.05, 4.51, 4.59, 4.69]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[0]"], "text": "The City can hire someone for now, before a test list exists.", "t0": 51.5, "t1": 54.93, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "In the seat first", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "temporary, exempt or provisional"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.44, 0.56, 0.79, 1.06, 1.2, 1.98, 2.29, 2.36, 2.62, 2.87]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Then the test comes, and the person already doing the job takes it.", "t0": 55.05, "t1": 58.65, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Already in the seat, by footing", "rows": [["temporary exempt", "1,922"], ["permanent exempt", "930"], ["provisional", "438"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.25, 0.58, 1.58, 1.74, 1.86, 2.25, 2.57, 2.82, 2.92, 3.23, 3.52]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "And how many were the only person ever hired from their list?", "t0": 58.77, "t1": 62.18, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "The only name on the list", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "683 ranked first"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.32, 0.56, 0.7, 0.84, 1.1, 1.5, 1.79, 2.12, 2.26, 2.42]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "325.", "t0": 62.18, "t1": 63.89, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "325", "label": "the only name ever appointed from the list"}, "emph": ["325"], "wt": [0.04, 0.4, 0.78]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "In the Technology department, it’s half of all hires: 50.3 percent.", "t0": 64.41, "t1": 68.63, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Share already in the seat", "rows": [["Technology", "50.3%"], ["Mayor", "40.8%"], ["Homelessness Services", "36.9%"]]}, "emph": ["50.3 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.24, 0.7, 1.17, 1.48, 1.74, 1.82, 1.99, 2.89, 3.25, 3.5, 3.72]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Why it matters: when the winner already holds the job, the contest may be decided before it starts.", "t0": 68.75, "t1": 75.59, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the contest decided"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.77, 1.81, 1.99, 2.09, 2.38, 2.76, 3.15, 3.26, 4.08, 4.24, 4.75, 4.91, 5.0, 5.82, 6.16, 6.28]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "The second lead: since 2018,", "t0": 75.81, "t1": 78.63, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "New job titles", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "first paid from fiscal 2018 on"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.58, 1.26, 1.54, 1.85]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "56 brand-new job titles started with just one or two people.", "t0": 78.63, "t1": 82.51, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "New job titles", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "first paid from fiscal 2018 on"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.68, 1.14, 1.41, 1.72, 2.01, 2.18, 2.5, 2.94, 3.21, 3.49]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "For 19, the title was written and filled in the same year.", "t0": 82.63, "t1": 86.18, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["written and filled together", "19"], "b": ["older titles, unused until then", "25"]}, "emph": ["same year"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 1.05, 1.2, 1.47, 1.6, 1.93, 2.21, 2.67, 2.83, 2.94, 3.23]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The third lead is vague titles, like manager or analyst.", "t0": 86.4, "t1": 89.27, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Manager. Analyst.", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "titles that say nothing about the work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.68, 0.79, 1.06, 1.48, 1.71, 2.2, 2.35]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "From 1,829 people to 3,555.", "t0": 89.39, "t1": 94.21, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1,829 to 3,555", "label": "people in generic titles, fiscal 2013 to 2026", "sub": "$604.0 million in fiscal 2026"}, "emph": ["From"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.4, 0.8, 1.05, 1.38, 1.88, 2.57, 2.74, 3.04, 3.45, 3.7, 4.08]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Analyst grades grew 132 percent. All City staff grew just 8 percent.", "t0": 94.73, "t1": 100.03, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["generic analyst grades", "+132%"], "b": ["all City staff", "8%"]}, "emph": ["132 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.8, 1.17, 1.36, 1.64, 2.1, 3.12, 3.48, 3.73, 4.06, 4.3, 4.6, 4.83]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "70 workers earned a quarter above the top of their pay scale, for years.", "t0": 100.25, "t1": 104.4, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Above the top of the scale", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "at least a quarter above the highest rate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.99, 1.28, 1.37, 1.74, 1.97, 2.08, 2.3, 2.37, 2.53, 2.75, 3.48, 3.67]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "27.2 million dollars.", "t0": 104.52, "t1": 106.3, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$27.2 million", "label": "above the top of the scale"}, "emph": ["27.2"], "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.75, 1.0, 1.33]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "How is that possible?", "t0": 106.82, "t1": 108.77, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a second pay schedule that the payroll file does not name"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.68, 0.89, 1.1]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "8 got the exact same salary, 286,278 dollars.", "t0": 108.77, "t1": 114.69, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a second pay schedule that the payroll file does not name"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.29, 0.5, 0.62, 1.07, 1.42, 2.4, 2.64, 3.02, 3.54, 4.26, 4.48, 4.87, 5.38]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "So there may be a second pay scale the records don’t name, or a higher acting job.", "t0": 114.81, "t1": 119.21, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a second pay schedule that the payroll file does not name"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.3, 0.45, 0.58, 0.68, 1.04, 1.25, 1.57, 1.69, 2.07, 2.35, 3.18, 3.36, 3.44, 3.74, 4.03]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "The fifth lead is managers.", "t0": 119.43, "t1": 120.89, "shot": "b21a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Managers", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "sub": "people paid in management classes, citywide"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.5, 0.71, 0.84]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "Citywide, they rose from 1,091 to 1,727.", "t0": 121.01, "t1": 126.28, "shot": "b21b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["fiscal 2013", "1,091"], "b": ["fiscal 2026", "1,727"], "kicker": "People paid in management classes", "arrows": false}, "emph": ["1,727"], "wt": [0.0, 0.64, 0.81, 1.12, 1.34, 1.57, 1.95, 2.86, 3.04, 3.23, 3.64, 3.95, 4.53]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "At the Human Rights Commission, managers went from 2.9 percent of staff to 17.7.", "t0": 126.4, "t1": 132.77, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Staff in management classes", "rows": [["Human Rights Commission", "17.7%"], ["Health Service System", "18.9%"], ["Retirement System", "30.4%"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.23, 0.53, 0.8, 1.7, 2.22, 2.4, 2.59, 3.1, 3.46, 3.76, 4.05, 4.12, 4.85, 5.05, 5.65, 5.96]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The payroll can’t show whether a job was advertised, or who else applied.", "t0": 132.99, "t1": 136.74, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any hire broke a rule", "Whether each job was advertised, and who else applied"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.52, 0.77, 1.0, 1.25, 1.32, 1.61, 1.77, 2.75, 2.88, 3.05, 3.25]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]"], "text": "What would settle it?", "t0": 136.86, "t1": 137.9, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Job postings and how long they stayed open"}, {"who": "", "what": "The full list of applicants"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.3, 0.58]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]"], "text": "The postings, how long they stayed open, and who else tried for each job.", "t0": 137.9, "t1": 142.0, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Job postings and how long they stayed open"}, {"who": "", "what": "The full list of applicants"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 1.11, 1.29, 1.48, 1.63, 1.9, 2.48, 2.64, 2.84, 3.1, 3.38, 3.5, 3.7]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Nothing here shows a rule was broken. No authority has ruled on it.", "t0": 142.12, "t1": 146.11, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.58, 0.87, 0.94, 1.18, 1.32, 2.24, 2.47, 3.34, 3.55, 3.83, 3.93]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 146.23, "t1": 148.33, "shot": "b26", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.31, 0.4, 0.47, 1.18, 1.36, 1.45]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Lead 1 · already in the seat", "lead2": "Lead 2 · new titles", "lead3": "Lead 3 · vague titles doubled", "lead4": "Lead 4 · above the scale", "lead5": "Lead 5 · more managers", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", 